---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="ページが見つかりません | STREAMER AGE"
  description="お探しのページは見つかりませんでした。STREAMER AGEのトップページから配信者を検索できます。"
  canonicalPath="/404/"
  noindex={true}
>
  <main class="not-found-main">
    <section class="not-found-card" aria-labelledby="not-found-heading">
      <p class="not-found-code" aria-hidden="true">404</p>
      <h1 id="not-found-heading">ページが見つかりません</h1>
      <p class="not-found-message">
        URLが変更されたか、ページが削除された可能性があります。
        トップページから配信者を探してみてください。
      </p>

      <div class="not-found-actions">
        <a class="not-found-primary" href="/">トップページへ戻る</a>
        <a class="not-found-secondary" href="/#streamer-search-input">
          配信者を検索する
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .not-found-main {
    display: grid;
    min-height: min(640px, calc(100vh - 180px));
    padding: clamp(48px, 9vw, 96px) 20px;
    place-items: center;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 18% 15%, rgb(117 89 232 / 18%), transparent 34%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 82% 70%, rgb(32 184 165 / 14%), transparent 34%),
      var(--color-navy);
  }

  .not-found-card {
    width: min(100%, 680px);
    padding: clamp(32px, 7vw, 56px);
    border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 12%);
    border-radius: var(--radius-large);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgb(0 0 0 / 24%);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .not-found-code {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-teal);
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: clamp(28px, 6vw, 44px);
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .not-found-message {
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 20px auto 0;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .not-found-actions {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 30px;
  }

  .not-found-actions a {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-height: 48px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 12px 18px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .not-found-primary {
    background: #5b36c8;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .not-found-primary:hover {
    background: #4726a8;
  }

  .not-found-secondary {
    border: 1px solid #b8e9e2;
    background: var(--color-teal-soft);
    color: #096b60;
  }

  .not-found-secondary:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-teal);
    background: #d4f6f1;
  }

  .not-found-actions a:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid rgb(32 184 165 / 48%);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .not-found-main {
      min-height: 540px;
      padding-inline: 16px;
    }

    .not-found-card {
      padding-inline: 22px;
    }

    .not-found-actions {
      align-items: stretch;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .not-found-actions a {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
